☁️ CREATING EC2 INSTANCE (AWS)

Create an AWS Account

Sign in to the AWS Management Console

In the search bar, type EC2 and click on it

Click Launch Instance

Enter the Instance Name

Select OS Image: Ubuntu

Choose Instance Type: t2.micro (Free Tier)

Select Key Pair:

Use existing or

Create a new key pair (.pem) file

Network Settings:

Check all required boxes (SSH, HTTP, HTTPS)

Configure Storage as needed

Click Launch Instance


